## How to Run the Simulation (EDA Playground):

No local tools needed – runs in your browser.

1. Go to [EDA Playground](https://www.edaplayground.com)
2. Copy the entire [`Design.v`] file into the **Design** pane.
3. Set:
   - **Tool:** `Icarus Verilog 12.0`
4. Tick **“Open EPWave”** to view the waveform.
5. Click **Run**.

The console will print the FSM transitions, toggle counts, and a **power savings report** (e.g., `Power savings ratio (×1000): 830` → 83%).

Open the waveform (`powergate_ip.vcd`) and observe:
- `fsm_state` changes between 001 (ACTIVE), 010 (IDLE), 100 (DEEP_SLEEP)
- `en_clk_radio`, `en_clk_imu`, `en_clk_temp` – gated clocks stop completely when the FSM disables the domain.
